  "mu_name": "Red Skeleton Knight",
  "mu_name_from": "MuMain _enum.h MONSTER_RED_SKELETON_KNIGHT_1 (88), drawn as MODEL_RED_SKELETON_KNIGHT = MODEL_MONSTER01 + 57, so OpenMonsterModel loads Monster58.bmd. WebZen's Monster.txt:116 calls breed 88 'Spirit Knight'; MuMain's English client and OpenMU S6 BloodCastle1.cs call it Red Skeleton Knight. docs/blood-castle-port.md Part B 3.",
