  "monster_from": "ZzzCharacter.cpp:13498-13511, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_RED_SKELETON_KNIGHT_1..8: OpenMonsterModel(MONSTER_MODEL_RED_SKELETON_KNIGHT); CreateCharacter(Key, MODEL_RED_SKELETON_KNIGHT, ...); Weapon[0] = MODEL_CHAOS_DRAGON_AXE at Level 8 in castles 1 and 2 (`!int((7 + (World - WD_11BLOODCASTLE_END)) / 3)`), 0 from castle 3; Scale = 1.19f. No BlendMesh, no effect.",
